# Netlify/Cloudflare Pages headers file — https://docs.netlify.com/routing/headers/
#
# A few baseline security headers, applied to every page. Deliberately
# conservative — no Content-Security-Policy here, since getting one
# right without breaking the admin panel (which loads scripts from
# identity.netlify.com and unpkg.com) or Google Fonts takes careful,
# live testing against the real deployed site; these three are safe,
# widely-recommended, and don't restrict anything the site actually
# does.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
